Services, phase 1 chỉ cần:
    postgres,
    redis
Sơ đồ
    Local Frontend :5173
        │
        ▼
    Local Backend :3000
        │
        ├── PostgreSQL :5432
        └── Redis :6379
Docker Compose
    services:
        postgres:
            image: postgres:16
            enviroment: 
                POSTGRES_DB: trading_plattform
                POSTGRES_USER: postgres
                POSTGRES_PASSWORD: postgres
            ports:
                - "5432:5432"
            volumes:
                - postgres_data:/var/lib/postgresql/data

        redis:
            image: redis:7-alpine
            ports:
                - "6379:6379"

    volumes:                                                                                                                                                                                
        postgres_data:

Deliverable 
    docker compose up -d